# Systems Override {2}{R}: "Gain control of target artifact or creature until end of turn. Untap that permanent. It gains haste until end of turn. If it's a
# Spacecraft, put ten charge counters on it. If you do, remove ten charge counters from it at the beginning of the next end step." Bot2 casts Class-F
# Shuttlecraft (station 6+: a 2/4 with flying and vigilance) and stations it once with Memnite, one charge counter, so it is no creature. On turn 3 Bot1 takes
# it: ten more counters make eleven, so it is a 2/4 flying artifact creature under Bot1, untapped and with haste, and attacks at once for 2.
# At the end step exactly ten counters come off, leaving the one it had: the Shuttlecraft is back under Bot2 as no creature.

